{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive land sailing adventure</strong> set in a post-apocalyptic world ruled by the wind. Cross the ruins of long gone civilizations and stitch the threads of history back together to uncover the origin of the fracture between man and nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.poster.avif?t=1761174784\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.webm?t=1761174784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.mp4?t=1761174784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience land sailing</strong> with dynamic controls that make it easy to learn through <strong>assisted sailing</strong> \u2014 with advanced <strong>manual controls available</strong> once you\u2019ve mastered the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face navigation challenges across diverse terrains, from storms and tornadoes to strange wind phenomena triggered by ancient artifacts that whip the world.<br>Gather resources and craft parts to <strong>maintain and customize your yacht</strong>, improving its performance and resilience for the journeys ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by your family\u2019s legacy<strong>,</strong> embark on a journey through a scarred world to uncover how past civilizations related to nature. Through relics, scattered logs, and memories carried by the wind, <strong>piece together the origins of the climate collapse</strong> \u2014 and face a moral choice at the heart of humanity\u2019s broken bond with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103810?t=1761174784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103810?t=1761174784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/cf7d9b2cccfd4205bb60dfa98ad3556fbf1b9e3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761174784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/cf7d9b2cccfd4205bb60dfa98ad3556fbf1b9e3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761174784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive land sailing adventure</strong> set in a post-apocalyptic world ruled by the wind. Cross the ruins of long gone civilizations and stitch the threads of history back together to uncover the origin of the fracture between man and nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.poster.avif?t=1761174784\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.webm?t=1761174784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/extras/c95f37436df63915ed49973687e97236.mp4?t=1761174784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience land sailing</strong> with dynamic controls that make it easy to learn through <strong>assisted sailing</strong> \u2014 with advanced <strong>manual controls available</strong> once you\u2019ve mastered the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face navigation challenges across diverse terrains, from storms and tornadoes to strange wind phenomena triggered by ancient artifacts that whip the world.<br>Gather resources and craft parts to <strong>maintain and customize your yacht</strong>, improving its performance and resilience for the journeys ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by your family\u2019s legacy<strong>,</strong> embark on a journey through a scarred world to uncover how past civilizations related to nature. Through relics, scattered logs, and memories carried by the wind, <strong>piece together the origins of the climate collapse</strong> \u2014 and face a moral choice at the heart of humanity\u2019s broken bond with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Contraviento"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103810/a61f0859d4f6d76f96bd5d675cc47793542de6c9/header.jpg?t=1761174784","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Upwind","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Contraviento"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\